<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, of fish, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεαρός</span>
			, <i>fresh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCair.Zen.
				616
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.58.63
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμίνηρος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηρόν, τό,</span>
			or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηρός, ὁ,</span>
			<i>water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				201.21
			</span></i> (Nubia, <span class="entity">vi A.D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				29
			</span></i>; acc. sg. written 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν νιρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					3.165.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>; cf. Mod.Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νερό.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νειρός</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				896
			</span></i>, glossed <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθυγρος,</span> Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηρίτης</span>
			 (interpol.), but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταπεινός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
